Dear geomorph group,

I hope you can help me!

I am analysing a 6 point landmark dataset for scapulae, with 3D landmarks collected by microscribe. However when I perform procrustes fit and PCA in MorphoJ vs geomorph, I get very different results. In MorphoJ, the data are expected with species well separated in morphospace, but in geomorph they form two parallel lines (see attached pictures). When I compare the mean shape, general alignment, and centroid size they are nearly the same. This doesn't seem to be related to left or right scapulae, since the landmarks are only on one side of the bone and follow the same numbering. My R and geomorph seem up to date, R version 4.4.2, geomorph 4.0.9.

My R code and data are attached as well. I appreciate any help!

Best, Stine

